  "description": "HoloNET Manager is a WPF desktop application and reusable component library that showcases every feature of HoloNET Client and HoloNET ORM. Acts as a Launcher, Dev Store, and hApp management console: install/enable/disable/uninstall hApps, manage agents, inspect cells, monitor network stats, browse DHT state, and exercise every ORM CRUD operation -- all with a polished UI. The backend components (ViewModels, services, data-binding helpers) are designed to be reused in your own .NET hApps. Planned ports to Uno, MAUI, and OpenSilver for Windows/Mac/Linux/mobile/web. Part of the OASIS Omniverse ecosystem at https://holonet.oasisomniverse.one -- Source: https://github.com/holochain-open-dev/holochain-client-csharp",
