  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v4.0.0 — Holochain 0.6.2 Upgrade + OASIS Omniverse Reboot (2026)\n\nThe biggest HoloNET release since its original launch — a complete upgrade to Holochain 0.6.2 alongside the full OASIS Omniverse ecosystem relaunch at https://holonet.oasisomniverse.one\n\n### Holochain 0.6.2 Upgrade\n- Full compatibility with the new Kitsune2 networking stack and Holochain 0.6.x conductor APIs\n- Upgraded GrantedFunctions wire format (string-keyed dictionary: \"All\"/\"Listed\" variants)\n- Support for new conductor admin APIs: InstallApp, EnableApp, AuthorizeSigningCredentials, GenerateAgentPubKey, and more\n- Clone cell support: CreateCloneCellAsync, EnableCloneCellAsync, DisableCloneCellAsync\n- Countersigning support: multi-agent atomic co-signing of DHT entries\n- WASM host functions: ListWasmHostFunctionsAsync, ProvideMemproofsAsync\n- App peer meta info: GetAppPeerMetaInfoAsync\n- Full HoloNETConfig expanded with Kitsune2Config, QUICConfig, NetworkConfig, KeystoreConfig, WASMConfig, CacheConfig\n\n### OASIS Omniverse Reboot\n- Now part of the unified OASIS Omniverse at https://oasisomniverse.one and https://holonet.oasisomniverse.one\n- Upgraded to .NET 10 for maximum performance and future-proofing\n- Copyright updated: NextGen Software Ltd 2019 - 2026\n- Full README overhaul: every class, event, method, and property documented with code examples\n- HoloNETClientAdmin fully documented: 33 admin events, 20+ admin methods\n- HoloNETCollection and HoloNETObservableCollection (ORM) fully documented with XAML WPF examples\n- All stale URLs updated to the new OASIS Omniverse domains\n- Improved error handling, reconnect stability, and async patterns throughout\n- Open source under MIT licence -- https://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/holochain-client-csharp",
